msgid "You can install it again from the store at any time."
msgstr "Anda dapat memasangnya kembali dari toko kapan saja."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Turn off Android?"
msgstr "Matikan Android?"

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Android apps that are open close. Android stays off, also after you log in again, until you open an Android app or turn it on here."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android yang terbuka akan ditutup. Android tetap mati, juga setelah Anda masuk lagi, sampai Anda membuka aplikasi Android atau mengaktifkannya di sini."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps?"
msgstr "Aktifkan aplikasi Android?"

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "F-Droid apps are Android apps: they run in Android (lapis) beside the desktop. Turning it on downloads Android once (about 1.3 GB) and may ask for your password. Store settings show how it goes."
msgstr "Aplikasi F-Droid adalah aplikasi Android: berjalan di Android (lapis) di samping desktop. Mengaktifkannya mengunduh Android sekali (sekitar 1,3 GB) dan mungkin meminta kata sandi Anda. Pengaturan toko menampilkan progresnya."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: src/ui/widgets.cpp
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Edit"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Lewati"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Kembali"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Start the tour"
msgstr "Mulai tur"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Mulai"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Berikutnya"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "WELCOME"
msgstr "SELAMAT DATANG"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Welcome to IGN 26"
msgstr "Selamat datang di IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu is ready to use. Take a short tour, under a minute, to find your way around."
msgstr "Bayu siap digunakan. Ikuti tur singkat, kurang dari satu menit, untuk mengenal sekelilingnya."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "BAYU STORE"
msgstr "BAYU STORE"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Install your first app"
msgstr "Pasang aplikasi pertama Anda"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu Store brings thousands of apps from Flathub and F-Droid together. Search, click Install, and it is done. Some to start with:"
msgstr "Bayu Store menghimpun ribuan aplikasi dari Flathub dan F-Droid. Cari, klik Pasang, selesai. Beberapa untuk memulai:"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Browse the web"
msgstr "Jelajahi web"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Documents, spreadsheets and slides"
msgstr "Dokumen, lembar kerja, dan slide"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Plays any video or music"
msgstr "Memutar video atau musik apa pun"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Bayu Store"
msgstr "Buka Bayu Store"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "LAUNCHER AND DOCK"
msgstr "LAUNCHER DAN DOCK"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Find every app"
msgstr "Temukan semua aplikasi"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Click the rocket in the dock to see all your apps, and type to search. Apps you install appear there at once. Drag one to the dock to keep it at hand."
msgstr "Klik roket di dock untuk melihat semua aplikasi Anda, lalu ketik untuk mencari. Aplikasi yang Anda pasang langsung muncul di sana. Seret satu ke dock agar mudah dijangkau."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Run Android apps"
msgstr "Jalankan aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps run in their own windows, next to your other apps, through lapis. Turning it on downloads Android once, about 1.3 GB."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android berjalan di jendelanya sendiri, berdampingan dengan aplikasi lain, melalui lapis. Mengaktifkannya mengunduh Android sekali, sekitar 1,3 GB."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "APPEARANCE"
msgstr "TAMPILAN"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "Buat sesuai selera Anda"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Choose light or dark, and a wallpaper. More choices are in Settings."
msgstr "Pilih terang atau gelap, dan wallpaper. Pilihan lainnya ada di Pengaturan."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "DESKTOP LAYOUT"
msgstr "TATA LETAK DESKTOP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Dock or panel"
msgstr "Dock atau panel"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "The Dock keeps a bar at the top, with the menus of the app in front, and your apps in a dock. The Panel puts everything in one bar along the bottom, with each app's menus in its window. The desktop changes at once."
msgstr "Dock menyimpan bilah di atas, berisi menu aplikasi yang sedang dipakai, dan aplikasi Anda di dock. Panel menaruh semuanya dalam satu bilah di bawah, dengan menu tiap aplikasi di jendelanya. Desktop langsung berubah."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Stay up to date"
msgstr "Tetap mutakhir"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "App updates are in Bayu Store, under Updates. System updates are in Settings, under System Update: they download in the background and install when you restart."
msgstr "Pembaruan aplikasi ada di Bayu Store, di bagian Pembaruan. Pembaruan sistem ada di Pengaturan, di bagian Pembaruan Sistem: diunduh di latar belakang dan dipasang saat Anda memulai ulang."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Updates"
msgstr "Buka Pembaruan"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "System Update"
msgstr "Pembaruan Sistem"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "ALL SET"
msgstr "SEMUA SIAP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Enjoy IGN 26"
msgstr "Selamat menikmati IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open this tour again any time from the launcher: look for Welcome."
msgstr "Buka tur ini lagi kapan saja dari launcher: cari Selamat Datang."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Show at login"
msgstr "Tampilkan saat masuk"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Welcome each time you sign in"
msgstr "Buka Selamat Datang setiap kali Anda masuk"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are not available on this system."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android tidak tersedia di sistem ini."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps"
msgstr "Aktifkan aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are on. Find them in Bayu Store under F-Droid."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android aktif. Temukan di Bayu Store di bagian F-Droid."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Setting up Android"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Waiting for your password."
msgstr "Menunggu kata sandi Anda."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Downloading Android: {done} of {total}"
msgstr "Mengunduh Android: {done} dari {total}"

